ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Campbell County has 75 years of record back to 1951, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 136% of normal in Feb-Mar and 63% in Nov-Dec. In 2026 so far Mar-Apr sits at 66% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grids 19984 and 19985 down at 67% of normal.</p>"}
